{
  "id": 8834788524231,
  "title": "Personalized Love and Relationships Quilt with Photo and Heart",
  "handle": "personalized-love-and-relationships-quilt-with-photo-and-heart-644d558a8f-644d558a8f",
  "body_html": "<p>Elevate your bedroom decor and cherish your most beautiful memories with this custom photo quilt by Jeminise. Perfect for keeping your family memories close, this personalized quilt is designed to bring warmth, comfort, and a touch of unique style to your home. Whether displayed on a bed, draped over a sofa, or used as a heartwarming gift, it serves as a beautiful keepsake for your loved ones.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize your quilt with high-resolution photo prints of your pets, family members, or friends, and add up to 2 custom text inputs to make it uniquely yours.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Premium Comfort:</strong> Made with a breathable cotton blend outer layer and filled with high-quality silk floss for the perfect balance of lightweight warmth and cozy durability.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Family Gift:</strong> An unforgettable gift option for moms, dads, grandparents, siblings, or friends on birthdays, anniversaries, Christmas, and other special occasions.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Highly functional for both indoor and outdoor activities, including reading, napping, lounging on the sofa, picnicking, or camping.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Designed for convenience, this quilt is machine washable, easy to clean, and dries quickly.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Cotton Blend</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester &amp; Cotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Silk Floss</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>8 Photo</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Bohemian</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Christmas</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Custom</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Blanket Form</th>\n<td>Throw Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw (60x70 inches), Twin (68x86 inches), Full (80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), King (91x102 inches)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Lightweight</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All, Spring, Winter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
